get.description:
`league`, `season` and `franchise_id` are all required, and restish takes them as positional
arguments in that order — `restish pff team-summary nfl 2024 14` (franchise ids come from
`team-list`). One row per game rather than per team, so a range of weeks gives a game-by-game line;
`--week` narrows it. Grades are on PFF's 0-100 scale and every other column is a raw total or rate;
which columns come back depends on the league, the query and the caller's entitlement.
